OL,3,GNEWSACycling mums to tow toddlers
OL,4,A1,000km across Turkey
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo British mothers are cycling across
OL,7,FTurkey with their toddlers in tow to
OL,8,Fprove adventure does not end with
OL,9,Fmotherhood.
OL,11,FVanessa Ruck, from Penallt in Wales,
OL,12,Fand Tori Williams from Cinderford in
OL,13,FGloucestershire are aiming to pedal
OL,14,F1,000km (621miles) in 25 days to raise
OL,15,Fmoney for Leukaemia UK.
OL,17,FWilliams lost her mother to leukaemia
OL,18,Fin 2000 when she was just 10 while
OL,19,FRuck, Nicknamed The Girl On A Bike,
OL,20,Funderwent seven surgeries after being
OL,21,Fhit by a car while cycling in 2014.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
