OL,3,GNEWSACycling mums to tow toddlers
OL,4,A1,000km across Turkey
OL,5,
OL,6,FRuck said: "We want to do it because
OL,7,Flife is really short, we both know that
OL,8,Ffrom our two different stories - and
OL,9,Fwhat's the worst that's going to
OL,10,Fhappen? We don't make it very far down
OL,11,Fthe road, but we're going to try."
